<title>FRANCE: Lagardere nine month sales edge higher.</title>
<headline>Lagardere nine month sales edge higher.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					37,652    vs   37,349</p>
<p>     High technology			    11,236    vs   10,770</p>
<p>     Automobile				    2,336    vs    3,962</p>
<p>     Communications/media		     24,026    vs   22,566</p>
<p>     Other						54    vs	 51</p>
<p>NOTE - Lagardere gave its sales figures in a statement. It said sales in the core high technology and communications and media sectors were growing in a highly satisfactory fashion despite an uncertain economic climate. The retreat in the automobile sector was due to the transition to the third from second generation Renault Espace utility vehicle, but the decline should be reversed in the beginning of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
